The Big Picture
Now connect all seven patterns.

Pattern	Main idea	Typical complexity
Array Traversal	Visit every element	O(n)
Two Pointers	Move two indices strategically	O(n)
Sliding Window	Maintain a contiguous window	O(n)
Prefix Sum	Precompute cumulative sums	O(n) build
Kadane	Best contiguous sum	O(n)
In-Place	Modify without extra array	O(n)
Intervals	Sort + merge/scan ranges	O(n log n)

